{%- comment -%}
  EIS — webfont loader.

  Rendered by every EIS section so each section stays self-contained and can be
  copied into any theme on its own. The browser de-duplicates the identical
  requests, so N sections still cost one font download.

  Faster option for production: paste these three tags once into the <head> of
  layout/theme.liquid and delete the `{% render 'eis-fonts' %}` line from each
  section. See INSTALL.md.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,600&family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,700&family=Manrope:wght@400;600&display=swap" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,600&family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,700&family=Manrope:wght@400;600&display=swap">
</noscript>
